;; COMMAND/FUNCTION REFERENCE
;; Start game: (mod-run-start)
;; Stop game: (mod-run-reset)
;; Force specific rule: (mod-rule-activate-slot 0 'rule-grounded)
;; Check if a specific slot is active: (mod-rule-slot-active? 0)

